<title>UK: Austria's PSK sets $250 million Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Austria's PSK sets $250 million Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Nomura and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE POSTSPARKASSE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.203   PAY DATE   S16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.903    SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.30	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
